ft is a white building with timber framing. Decorative red, white, and green bunting (the colours of the Welsh flag) hangs overhead.' referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://pxscdn.com/public/m/_v2/787879165920376064/9a26d276d-23d3a8/BrXIsg6IFcFP/6iUXoh35q2Q0JemHZpsZC90rrfDyt9bK5BTThlDY.jpg"/&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://pixelfed.social/p/Jess.Stetson/989297967619474952</link><description>&lt;img alt="A heavily edited dark photo of a metal lion monument. The lion is sitting upright, with striking glowing crimson red paint dripping from its eyes like blood and vibrant yellow paint dripping down off the tips of its sharp claws against a dark, moody background." referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://pxscdn.com/public/m/_v2/787879165920376064/9a26d276d-23d3a8/b0zyEpuCfK7H/GYTgVwuumahiVr4XloACAqITnfYs01ckrjRuCbtM.jpg"/&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://pixelfed.social/p/Jess.Stetson/989285623184457688</link><description>&lt;img alt="Close-up of a black cat resting her head on a textured white bedspread. She is looking directly at the camera with large yellow-green eyes with slit pupils and her sharp pointed ear is up and alert." referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://pxscdn.com/public/m/_v2/787879165920376064/9a26d276d-23d3a8/IlgyIbp7JKwn/HwBAPx7CI8yxVCezPW802WvffxFztp5aEjCzlc8d.jpg"/&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>